sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    actor C as Cliente
    participant O as Order Service
    participant B as RabbitMQ
    participant S as Saga Orchestrator
    participant I as Inventory Service
    participant P as Payment Service
    participant G as Gateway
    C->>O: POST /orders
    O-->>C: 202 Accepted / PENDING
    O-->>B: OrderCreated (Outbox)
    B-->>S: OrderCreated
    S-->>B: ReserveStock
    B-->>I: ReserveStock
    I-->>B: StockReserved(HELD)
    B-->>S: StockReserved
    S-->>B: ChargePayment
    B-->>P: ChargePayment
    P->>G: Cobrar via HTTPS, chave idempotente
    G-->>P: DECLINED final, nenhum débito
    P-->>B: PaymentDeclined
    B-->>S: PaymentDeclined (WAITING_RELEASE)
    rect rgb(255, 246, 235)
      Note over S,I: Compensação em ordem inversa - sem RefundPayment
      S-->>B: ReleaseStock(reservationId)
      B-->>I: ReleaseStock
      I-->>B: StockReleased(RELEASED)
      B-->>S: StockReleased
      S-->>B: CancelOrder
      B-->>O: CancelOrder
      O-->>B: OrderCancelled(CANCELLED)
      B-->>S: OrderCancelled (COMPENSATED)
    end
    Note over S,O: Pedido PENDING -> CANCELLED. Pagamento recusado: sem estorno.
